## Sensor product pages (locked structure)

The sensor catalogue pages share an approved layout. **Structure is frozen**;
**content is not**. Do not reorder sections, change layout modes, or refactor
the page shells below without explicit user approval. Module landing pages are
covered separately below.

### Sensor detail (`/[lang]/sensors/[slug]/`)

Shell via [`PlaceholderPage`](src/components/PlaceholderPage.astro): breadcrumbs
→ hero (no product image) → body (`max-w-3xl`) → bottom `CtaBand`. Enhanced
pages: primary CTA = Book demo; secondary = Get an offer. Thin pages without
content stay `noindex` with a minimal gallery only.

Enhanced body order in [`SensorPageContent.astro`](src/components/content/SensorPageContent.astro):

1. Product views — `SensorProductGallery` (`layout="editorial"`, `omitInUse`) + hero spec chips
2. Why choose this sensor? — benefits grid
